From 25e5f1f016cb8412abecfb95fcd504e93735d988 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vaciller <wyc_19533480830@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 01:28:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: implement custom car headunit navigation bar

    - Lock navbar height at 72dp across all configurations
    - Force pure black background (#FF000000) and white icons (#FFFFFFFF)
    - Replace back/home icons with Heroicons stroke variants
    - Add apps, settings, volume up/down/mute buttons to navbar layout
    - Add AppListActivity for app grid launched from navbar apps button
    - Control all customizations via persist.sys.headunit_navbar=1

Change-Id: I4010aea4d8eb90ff3b222431a11a30009cd47065
